"Welcome to Launchy" = "欢迎使用 Launchy";
"This SwiftUI scaffold is ready for your ideas." = "这个 SwiftUI 构架已为你的创意准备妥当。";
"Increase Counter" = "增加计数器";
"Counter: %lld" = "计数器：%lld";

"Floaty or fullscreen" = "浮层还是全屏";
"Pick the layout that fits the moment. Floaty hovers above your desktop, while fullscreen feels like classic Launchpad." = "选择适合当下的布局。Floaty 漂浮在桌面之上，全屏则还原经典 Launchpad 的感受。";
"Floaty mode" = "浮层模式";
"A panel that stays light and quick. Hide the Dock icon if you want a minimal feel." = "保持轻盈快捷的面板。若想极简，可隐藏 Dock 图标。";
"Fullscreen mode" = "全屏模式";
"Fill the screen for a focused, grid-first workflow." = "填满屏幕，打造专注的网格优先工作流。";
"Flip instantly" = "即时切换";
"Add a layout toggle shortcut in Settings to jump between modes anytime." = "在设置中添加布局切换快捷键，随时跳转模式。";
"Hotkeys you control" = "你掌控的快捷键";
"Launchy ships with Cmd+Shift+Space, but you can set your own shortcuts in Settings > Keyboard." = "Launchy 默认 Cmd+Shift+Space，但你可在 设置 > 键盘 中设定自己的快捷键。";
"Toggle Launchy anywhere" = "在任何地方切换 Launchy";
"Record the shortcut you want to open or hide the launcher." = "记录你想用来打开或隐藏启动器的快捷键。";
"Layout toggle" = "布局切换";
"Set an optional hotkey to swap floaty and fullscreen on demand." = "设定可选快捷键，即刻在 Floaty 与全屏之间切换。";
"Reset friendly" = "友好的重置";
"Use Reset in Settings if you ever want the defaults back." = "若想恢复出厂设置，可在设置中使用重置。";
"Search & organize" = "搜索与整理";
"Type to filter instantly, drag to reorder, and build folders when you need them." = "输入即可即时筛选，拖动重排，需要时建立文件夹。";
"Instant search" = "即时搜索";
"The search bar narrows results as you type, then Enter launches the first match." = "搜索栏会随着输入收窄结果，按回车便能启动首个匹配项。";
"Rearrange easily" = "轻松重新排列";
"Drag icons to reorder pages. Hold Option or Shift while dragging to create folders." = "拖动图标即可重新安排页面。拖拽时按住 Option 或 Shift，即可创建文件夹。";
"Name folders fast" = "快速命名文件夹";
"Drop onto another app to make a folder, then rename it inline." = "拖到另一个应用即可创建文件夹，随后直接重命名。";
"Right-click for power" = "右键释放能力";
"Context menus unlock more control wherever you click." = "上下文菜单让你在任意点击处获得更多控制。";
"App actions" = "应用操作";
